You should have wished for the Wallet blessed and greased, but if you
forgot, try to be very careful around water.
Apparently these are what you wished for to begin with before leaving
the level. Fairly good choices.

> ring of slow digestion

This is considered mandatory for a vampire, although some would dispute
that.  It might as well be your next wish.
That will leave you with 4 remaining wishes.

> robe of power
> helm of brilliance
> spellbook of identify

These are useless in the early game. Forget them.
In particular, the Identify spell is pretty useless in Slashem, since
every general store will happily identify everything for a small price.

> silver dragon scale mail

This is useful, but with 4 wishes you might have a better choice.

In my opinion, your best bet would be to go with the 'crystal golem'
option, which requires 3 wishes (or two if you already have a source of
polymorph):
1) Ring of polymorph control
2) Amulet of unchanging
3) Wand of polymorph or ring of polymorph

Once you have transformed yourself into a crystal golem, put on the
amulet of unchanging, remove the ring of polymorph control, and stay
that way for most of the rest of the game.  You will have at least 300
HP, all useful resistances including MR and reflection, good AC, a
random breath attack, 18/** strength, etc.  You will be unable to
speak, though, so you will not be able to buy protection or farm
gypsies for wishes in golem form.

Afterwards, find an altar and get the "Serpent's Tongue", build up your
dagger skill and get a dagger stack ASAP.  You should then be almost
YASD-proofed - but still be careful and remember to use Elbereth often.



